-flat-shoe','Alibaba','Baba','Product Name: Women\'s Sneaker Color: White/Khaki/Blue','PU Upper Material: The PU upper material ensures durability and easy maintenance, making these sneakers suitable for regular use.\r\n\r\nPVC Outsole Material: The PVC outsole provides good traction and wear resistance, enhancing the overall longevity of the shoes.','/uploads/products/ab7822c4d5b7b2278512_1791799108.webp',NULL,28.80,32.50,32.50,'USD','INR',288.01,1,100,3,1000,0,3.57,'PVC','Red, Black, White','35X20X25 cm','.6 Kg',NULL,1,0,1,0,0,1,1,1,1,'5','Mumbai','PUBLISHED','APPROVED',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,4,'2026-10-12 15:28:28','2026-10-15 17:04:14'),(32,16,4,7,'Adidas FIFA World Cup 26™ League Football','adidas-fifa-world-cup-26-league-football','FT','Programmers Point1','Adidas FIFA World Cup 26™ League Football','WORLD CUP 26-INSPIRED DESIGN – Flowing 4-panel “la ola” wave graphics that borrow the look and energy of the tournament’s official ball. SEAMLESS TSBE TOUCH – TSBE technology delivers a seamless feel for cleaner contact and more consistent play. MICRO-TEXTURED FOR PRECISION – Fine texture + debossing help improve control, precision, and in-flight stability. BUTYL BLADDER = AIR RETENTION – Butyl bladder helps lock in air so the ball keeps its shape game after game. TRAINING + MATCH READY DURABILITY – Made for training and matches with a TPU-laminated, durable surface; FIFA Quality testing for key performance metrics.','/uploads/products/d21f837a658dce3f3ceb_1791869279.jpg',NULL,32.00,35.00,35.00,'USD','INR',2649.00,1,10,1,1000,0,35.70,'American Football','red brwon','45*10','430 Grams',NULL,1,0,0,0,1,1,1,3,6,'10 - 20 Business Days','All Adavnce','PUBLISHED','APPROVED',NULL,1,'2026-10-14 17:17:47',NULL,NULL,1,0,13,'2026-10-13 10:57:59','2026-10-16 14:21:36'),(58,35,1,1,'Supplier 1 Exclusive Equipment 1792148942','supplier-1-exclusive-1792148942',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,140.00,160.00,140.00,'USD',NULL,NULL,1,10,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,